  "idea": "Microsoft Copilot Studio improvements for custom enterprise bots",
  "text": "Microsoft just released an update that directly connects Office 365 to external databases. Operations teams waste hours copying inventory rows and customer numbers between SQL tables and Excel spreadsheets. Manual data syncs inevitably introduce clerical mistakes and break mission-critical weekly executive reporting pipelines. Power Automate connectors now bridge Azure SQL and Snowflake directly into your native Microsoft 365 workspace. You sync live enterprise data without touching third-party middleware.",
